{"title":"Ambience Features","sourceTitle":"Ambience Features/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages noprint navigation-not-searchable\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages-label\">Other languages:</div><ul class=\"mw-pt-languages-list\"><li><a href=\"/Ambience_Features\" class=\"mw-pt-languages-ui mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Ambience Features (100% translated)\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">English</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Ambience_Features/es\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" title=\"Fenómenos naturales (2% translated)\" lang=\"es\" dir=\"ltr\">español</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Ambience_Features/fr\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" title=\"Fonctions d&#39;Ambiance (2% translated)\" lang=\"fr\" dir=\"ltr\">français</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-pt-languages-selected mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\">português do Brasil</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Ambience_Features/ru\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" title=\"Особенности окружения (2% translated)\" lang=\"ru\" dir=\"ltr\">русский</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Ambience_Features/uk\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"Ambience Features/uk (39% translated)\" lang=\"uk\" dir=\"ltr\">українська</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Ambience_Features/zh\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"环境效果 (100% translated)\" lang=\"zh\" dir=\"ltr\">中文</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Ambience_Features/ja\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" title=\"自然現象 (2% translated)\" lang=\"ja\" dir=\"ltr\">日本語</a></li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"center\" style=\"background-color: #eee; border-style: solid; border-width: 1px 1px 1px 4px; border-color: #88acf5; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 85%; width: 90%; padding: 0.2em; margin: 0.5em auto; margin-left:0px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: flex-start; align-items: center; padding-left: 10px\">\n<div style=\"margin-left: 10px; text-align: left;\">\n<p>Esta página foi verificada pela última vez para a versão do Vintage Story <b>1.21.6</b>.\n</p>\n</div></div></div>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<div style=\"margin: 0 1em 1em; padding: 4px; border-color: #382b1e; border-width: 3px; border-style: solid; float:right; width:250px; border-radius: 4px; background-color: #e0cfbb;\">\n<table style=\"border-spacing: 2px; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background: rgb(91,76,62); background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(91,76,62,0) 5px, rgba(56,43,30,0) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%), linear-gradient(to right, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 5px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 50%, rgba(69,52,36,1) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%);&#125;&#125;\">\n<big><b><span style=\"color: #e0cfbb\">Ambience</span></b></big></th></tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"margin:auto; text-align:center;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Glow-Ambiance.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/6/67/Glow-Ambiance.jpg/180px-Glow-Ambiance.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"104\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/6/67/Glow-Ambiance.jpg/270px-Glow-Ambiance.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/6/67/Glow-Ambiance.jpg/360px-Glow-Ambiance.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"3840\" data-file-height=\"2224\" /></a></span></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:60%\"><b>Natural Phenomena</b></td><td> Organisms, Weather, Astronomy</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<p>Vintage Story possui, além dos itens e processos funcionais, também diversos fenômenos adicionados exclusivamente para fazer o jogo parecer mais vivo e ainda mais bonito. A maioria deles não tem uso aparente no momento.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p>V<a href=\"/index.php?title=1.20.0&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1.20.0 (page does not exist)\">1.20.0</a> saw many additions to the game's ambiance, notably in the form of insect life such as grasshoppers. Other updates have sought to make the sky astronomically accurate, depicting the placement of stars and constellations true to each season and the moon within each of the waxing and waning phases of its travel.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#aurora\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">aurora</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Borboletas\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Borboletas</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Superlua\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Superlua</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Super_Moon\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Super Moon</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Vaga-lumes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Vaga-lumes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Plâncton_Bioluminescente\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Plâncton Bioluminescente</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Larvas_luminosas\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Larvas luminosas</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Coquis\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Coquis</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Cicadas\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Cicadas</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Fireflies\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Fireflies</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Pular_pedras\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Pular pedras</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Tree_Seeds\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Tree Seeds</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Caves\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">13</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Caves</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#Glow_Worms\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">13.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Glow Worms</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-15\"><a href=\"#Water\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">14</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Water</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-16\"><a href=\"#Fish\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">14.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Fish</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-17\"><a href=\"#Gnat_Swarms\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">14.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gnat Swarms</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-18\"><a href=\"#Water_Striders\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">14.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Water Striders</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-19\"><a href=\"#Bioluminescent_Plankton\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">14.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Bioluminescent Plankton</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-20\"><a href=\"#Skipping_Stones\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">14.5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Skipping Stones</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<p><span id=\"Sky\"></span>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"aurora\">aurora</span></h3>\n<p>Em áreas muito frias como os pólos do mundo, o jogador pode encontrar auroras no céu.\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Aurora.PNG\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/c/c6/Aurora.PNG/300px-Aurora.PNG\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"164\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/c/c6/Aurora.PNG/450px-Aurora.PNG 1.5x, /images/thumb/c/c6/Aurora.PNG/600px-Aurora.PNG 2x\" data-file-width=\"1362\" data-file-height=\"746\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><span id=\"Lunar&#95;Phases\"></span>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Borboletas\"><a href=\"/Butterfly\" title=\"Butterfly\">Borboletas</a></span></h3>\n<p><br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</p>\n</div>\n<p>The moon passes through each of the 8 phases, including the four primary phases (new moon, first quarter, full moon, and third quarter) and the four intermediate phases (waxing crescent, waxing gibbous, waning gibbous, and waning crescent).  \n</p><p><br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><span id=\"Eclipse\"></span>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Superlua\">Superlua</span></h3>\n<p><br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</p>\n</div>\n<p>The moon is capable of passing between the sun and earth, producing an eclipse that momentarily blocks out the sun and lowers light levels considerably. \n</p><p><br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</p><p><br /> \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Super_Moon\">Super Moon</span></h3>\n<p>The Super Moon is when the moon is in its Full Moon phase and appears to be larger than usual, due to the moon reaching <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Apsis\">perigee</a> and from lunar <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Libration\">libration</a>. \n<br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</p><p><br /> \n<span id=\"Aurora\"></span>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Vaga-lumes\">Vaga-lumes</span></h3>\n<p>Encontrados principalmente em pastagens e apenas à noite, os vaga-lumes aparecem como pequenos aglomerados de luzes piscantes.\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Fireflies.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/1/13/Fireflies.png/300px-Fireflies.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"161\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/1/13/Fireflies.png/450px-Fireflies.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/1/13/Fireflies.png/600px-Fireflies.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"809\" data-file-height=\"433\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</p>\n</div>\n<p>In areas where the average annual temperature is below -5°C, the player can encounter weaving auroras in the sky. Note: you can check your location's climate with the command <code>/wgen pos climate</code>.\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Aurora.PNG\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/c/c6/Aurora.PNG/300px-Aurora.PNG\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"164\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/c/c6/Aurora.PNG/450px-Aurora.PNG 1.5x, /images/thumb/c/c6/Aurora.PNG/600px-Aurora.PNG 2x\" data-file-width=\"1362\" data-file-height=\"746\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</p><p><br /> \n<span id=\"Wilderness\"></span>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<h3><span id=\"Pl.C3.A2ncton_Bioluminescente\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Plâncton_Bioluminescente\">Plâncton Bioluminescente</span></h3>\n<p>Indo o suficiente para o sul, o jogador poderá notar pequenas luzes azuis seguindo seus movimentos pela água.\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Bioluminescent_Plankton.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/7/72/Bioluminescent_Plankton.png/300px-Bioluminescent_Plankton.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"165\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/7/72/Bioluminescent_Plankton.png/450px-Bioluminescent_Plankton.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/7/72/Bioluminescent_Plankton.png/600px-Bioluminescent_Plankton.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"781\" data-file-height=\"430\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><span id=\"Grasshoppers\"></span>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Larvas_luminosas\">Larvas luminosas</span></h3>\n<p>Em algumas cavernas, o jogador pode não apenas encontrar estalagmites e estalactites, mas também vermes azuis brilhantes pendurados no teto. Eles não podem ser colhidos nem movidos ou replantados em outro lugar. Eles emitem um nível de luz de 7.\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Glow_Worms.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/e/ef/Glow_Worms.png/300px-Glow_Worms.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"169\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/e/ef/Glow_Worms.png/450px-Glow_Worms.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/e/ef/Glow_Worms.png/600px-Glow_Worms.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"765\" data-file-height=\"430\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</p>\n</div>\n<p>As of v<a href=\"/index.php?title=1.20.0&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1.20.0 (page does not exist)\">1.20.0</a> Grasshoppers are found in grassy fields and appear as tiny hopping green particles, and with accompanying sound effects.\n</p><p><br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</p><p><br /> \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Coquis\">Coquis</span></h3>\n<p>As of v<a href=\"/index.php?title=1.20.0&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1.20.0 (page does not exist)\">1.20.0</a> Coquis are found in swamps and appear as tiny hopping green particles, sounding like chips.\n</p><p><br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Cicadas\">Cicadas</span></h3>\n<p>As of v<a href=\"/index.php?title=1.20.0&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1.20.0 (page does not exist)\">1.20.0</a> Cicadas are found in taller trees, their stridulation sound effects localized per tree they are in for directional sound.\n</p><p><br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</p><p><br /> \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Fireflies\">Fireflies</span></h3>\n<p>Found mostly on grasslands and only at night, fireflies spawn as little clusters of blinking lights. \n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Fireflies.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/1/13/Fireflies.png/300px-Fireflies.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"161\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/1/13/Fireflies.png/450px-Fireflies.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/1/13/Fireflies.png/600px-Fireflies.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"809\" data-file-height=\"433\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</p><p><br /> \n</p><p><span id=\"Butterflies\"></span>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Pular_pedras\">Pular pedras</span></h3>\n<p>O jogador pode pular pedras jogando-as em um ângulo raso ao longo da água.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p>Butterflies are the only insect fully rendered in its natural shape and appearing as more than a block particle. As of v<a href=\"/index.php?title=1.18.0&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1.18.0 (page does not exist)\">1.18.0</a> there are over 160 varieties of butterfly in Vintage Story and 50 can be caught and worn as a decorative pin. See <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Butterfly\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Butterfly\">Borboleta</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Butterfly\" title=\"Butterfly\"> </a></span> for more.\n</p><p><br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</p><p><br /> \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Tree_Seeds\">Tree Seeds</span></h3>\n<p>Trees will drop seeds when leafy branches are broken, but will additioanlly produce particle effects of falling seeds. Maple seeds in particular will move more slowly and can be seen rotating or twirling as they descend to the ground.\n</p><p><br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Caves\">Caves</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Glow_Worms\">Glow Worms</span></h3>\n<p>In some caves, the player might not only find stalagmites and stalactites, but also blue glowing worms hanging from the ceiling. They cannot be harvested nor can they be moved or replanted somewhere else. They emit a light level of 7.\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Glow_Worms.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/e/ef/Glow_Worms.png/300px-Glow_Worms.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"169\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/e/ef/Glow_Worms.png/450px-Glow_Worms.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/e/ef/Glow_Worms.png/600px-Glow_Worms.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"765\" data-file-height=\"430\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</p><p><br /> \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Water\">Water</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Fish\">Fish</span></h3>\n<p>As of v<a href=\"/index.php?title=1.21.0&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1.21.0 (page does not exist)\">1.21.0</a> saltwater fish are found in oceans. These were initially clusters of moving particles to simulate schools of reef fish.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gnat_Swarms\">Gnat Swarms</span></h3>\n<p>As of v<a href=\"/index.php?title=1.20.0&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1.20.0 (page does not exist)\">1.20.0</a> mating Gnats are found swarming above bodies of water and often around cattail plants.\n</p><p><br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Water_Striders\">Water Striders</span></h3>\n<p>As of v<a href=\"/index.php?title=1.20.0&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1.20.0 (page does not exist)\">1.20.0</a> Water Striders are found skating along the surface of water, appearing as tiny grey particles.\n</p><p><br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</p><p><br /> \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bioluminescent_Plankton\">Bioluminescent Plankton</span></h3>\n<p>Going far enough south, the player might notice tiny blue lights following their movements through water. \n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Bioluminescent_Plankton.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/7/72/Bioluminescent_Plankton.png/300px-Bioluminescent_Plankton.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"165\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/7/72/Bioluminescent_Plankton.png/450px-Bioluminescent_Plankton.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/7/72/Bioluminescent_Plankton.png/600px-Bioluminescent_Plankton.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"781\" data-file-height=\"430\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</p><p><br /> \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Skipping_Stones\">Skipping Stones</span></h3>\n<p>The player can skip stones by throwing them with a shallow angle along water.\n</p><p><br />\n<br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</p>\n<div style=\"margin: auto; padding: 4px; border-color: #382b1e; border-width: 3px; border-style: solid; margin: auto; width: 90%; border-radius: 4px; background-color: #e0cfbb;\">\n<table class=\"mw-collapsible\" style=\"border-spacing: 2px; width: 100%;\">\n  <tbody><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background: rgb(91,76,62); background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(91,76,62,0) 5px, rgba(56,43,30,0) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%), linear-gradient(to right, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 5px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 50%, rgba(69,52,36,1) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%);\">\n    <big><b><span style=\"color: #e0cfbb\">Navegação Wiki</span></b></big></th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"height: 30px; text-align: center; width: 10%; background: #5B4C3E; color:#e0cfbb;\"><b>História antiga</b></td>\n    <td style=\"background: #e0cfbb;\"><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/:Category:Guides\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/:Category:Guides\">Guias</a><span style=\"display:none\">[[::Category:Guides| ]]</span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Frequently_Asked_Questions_(FAQ)\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)\">Perguntas frequentes</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Frequently_Asked_Questions_(FAQ)\" title=\"Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Vintage_Story_Original_Soundtrack\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Vintage Story Original Soundtrack\">Trilha sonora</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Vintage_Story_Original_Soundtrack\" title=\"Vintage Story Original Soundtrack\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Version_history\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Version history\">Versões</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Version_history\" title=\"Version history\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Controls\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Controls\">Controles</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Controls\" title=\"Controls\"> </a></span></td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td style=\"height: 30px; text-align: center; width: 10%; background: #5B4C3E; color:#e0cfbb;\"><b>Sistemas de jogo</b></td>\n    <td style=\"background: #CCBCAB;\"><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Crafting\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Crafting\">Fabricação</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Crafting\" title=\"Crafting\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:My